        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"zh\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>诗歌鉴赏答题模式</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = {\n  tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] }\n};\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body {\n    font-family: \"SimSun\", \"Songti SC\", serif;\n    font-size: 14px;\n    color: #111;\n    line-height: 1.9;\n    max-width: 700px;\n    margin: 30px auto;\n    padding: 20px 40px;\n  }\n  .top-block p {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n    text-indent: 0;\n  }\n  .eg {\n    margin: 4px 0 20px 0;\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  h2.title {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 16px;\n    margin-top: 30px;\n    margin-bottom: 10px;\n  }\n  h3.section {\n    font-weight: bold;\n    font-size: 15px;\n    margin-top: 20px;\n    margin-bottom: 8px;\n  }\n  .block {\n    margin-left: 0.5em;\n  }\n  .block p {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  ol.steps {\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 1.2em;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  ol.steps li {\n    margin: 2px 0;\n  }\n  ol.circled {\n    list-style: none;\n    margin: 2px 0 2px 1.2em;\n    padding: 0;\n  }\n  .indent2 {\n    text-indent: 2em;\n  }\n  .poem-block {\n    margin: 6px 0 6px 0.5em;\n  }\n  .poem-title-line {\n    display: flex;\n    justify-content: space-between;\n    max-width: 320px;\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  .poem-lines {\n    margin: 4px 0;\n  }\n  .poem-lines .line {\n    display: inline-block;\n    margin-right: 30px;\n  }\n  .note {\n    margin: 4px 0 4px 0;\n  }\n  .qa p {\n    margin: 3px 0;\n  }\n  .uncertain {\n    color: #444;\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n<div class=\"top-block\">\n  <p>2、寄寓高尚的节操，或表达怀才不遇与命途多舛的伤感，或抒发年华易逝与理想破灭的悲怆。</p>\n  <p>3、托物讽世，或忧国忧民，或感时伤世，或惧一世俗，或针砭时弊，或讥嘲热讽</p>\n  <p class=\"eg\">Eg：词人借不与群芳争春，虽然粉身碎骨而芳香如故的梅花来表达自己虽遭受不幸，前途坎坷，但决不同流合污的高尚节操以及粉身碎骨而矢志不渝的斗争精神。</p>\n</div>\n\n<h2 class=\"title\">诗歌鉴赏答题模式：</h2>\n\n<h3 class=\"section\">(一) 分析意境型：</h3>\n\n<div class=\"block\">\n  <p>1. 提问方式：</p>\n  <p class=\"indent2\">此诗有什么样的意境？表现了怎样的画面？诗人通过什么景物表达自己的感情？</p>\n\n  <p>2. 答题步骤：</p>\n  <p class=\"indent2\">①用4个字概括景物营造氛围特点</p>\n  <p class=\"indent2\">孤寂冷清；萧瑟凄凉；雄浑壮阔；恬静幽美+明净雅致；慷慨悲壮；</p>\n  <p class=\"indent2\">②描写初始中展现的途径和画面（翻译--忠于原文）。</p>\n  <p class=\"indent2\">③回答表现诗人什么感情（先答原因，后答情感）。</p>\n\n  <p>3. 答题示例：</p>\n  <div class=\"poem-block\">\n    <div class=\"poem-title-line\">\n      <span>绝句二首（其一）</span>\n      <span>杜甫</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"poem-lines\">\n      <span class=\"line\">迟日江山丽，春风花草香。</span>\n      <span class=\"line\">泥融飞燕子，沙暖睡鸳鸯。</span>\n    </div>\n    <p class=\"note\">注：此诗写于诗人经过一<span class=\"uncertain\">[?]</span>颠沛流离的奔波流离之后，暂时居成都草堂时。</p>\n    <div class=\"qa\">\n      <p>问：此诗描绘了怎样的景物？表达了诗人怎样的情感？请简要分析。</p>\n      <p>答：这首诗描绘了一幅明净绚丽的图景：①此诗描绘出一派美丽的初春景象：春天阳光普照，江水映衬，春花远远花草鲜香，泥融土湿，燕子正忙忙的衔泥筑巢，日丽沙暖，鸳鸯在沙滩上静睡不动。②表现了诗人结束奔波流离生活安定后悦怀适的心境。</p>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n<h3 class=\"section\">(二) 分析技巧型：</h3>\n\n<div class=\"block\">\n  <p>1. 提问方式：</p>\n  <p class=\"indent2\">怎样的表现手法？怎样的艺术手法？怎样的技巧（手法）？怎样抒发感情的？</p>\n\n  <p>2. 答题步骤：</p>\n  <p class=\"indent2\">①明确告诉其手法。</p>\n  <p class=\"indent2\">②结合诗句证明为什么。</p>\n  <p class=\"indent2\">③运用这种手法有效地表达出因--而产生的--情感。</p>\n\n  <p>3. 答题示例：</p>\n  <div class=\"poem-block\">\n    <div class=\"poem-title-line\">\n      <span>早行</span>\n      <span>陈与义</span>\n    </div>\n    <div class=\"poem-lines\">\n      <span class=\"line\">露侵驼裘晓寒轻，星斗阑干分外明。</span>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n</div>\n\n</body>\n</html>"
